#: ../../docstring of pdf_extract.PdfExtractAssetsStandard:3
msgid ""
"**A divergence absorbed here:** the Python signature takes fourteen flat "
"keywords, three per numeric column, while the native type groups each "
"triple into one column. The flat signature is kept, and the grouping "
"happens in `assets_column`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docstring of pdf_extract.PdfExtractInvestmentsStandard:3
msgid ""
"**A divergence absorbed here:** two of the selections are accepted and "
"ignored. That is not an oversight — they were never used on this side "
"either, the currency and the management company arriving from sibling "
"pipes. The native type, having no compatibility constraint, does not have"
" them at all, but author modules still pass them, so the Python signature"
" must still accept them."
msgstr ""

